Calling `existsSync(path)` right before `statSync(path)` is redundant and introduces a Time-of-Check to Time-of-Use (TOCTOU) race condition. Since `statSync` is already wrapped in a `try-catch` block, we can safely omit `existsSync` entirely. This avoids an extra filesystem I/O operation and simplifies the logic.

