![medium](https://www.gstatic.com/codereviewagent/medium-priority.svg)

The `listChildDirectories` function uses `entry.isDirectory()` from `readdirSync(..., { withFileTypes: true })`. This does not follow symbolic links, meaning any symlinks to directories inside `parentDir` (such as symlinked local repositories in `~/Git`) will be ignored. Using `statSync` on each path resolves symlinks correctly.

```typescript
function listChildDirectories(parentDir: string): string[] {
  try {
    return readdirSync(parentDir)
      .map((name) => join(parentDir, name))
      .filter((pathName) => {
        try {
          return statSync(pathName).isDirectory();
        } catch {
          return false;
        }
      });
  } catch {
    return [];
  }
}
```

